WEBVTT

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:30.880
How is he?

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:33.680
He's stayed here quietly since then.

00:00:34.190 --> 00:00:38.120
Yeah, he's sickeningly well behaved.

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:40.420
He hasn't made a single complaint.

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.860
I can't handle guys like that.

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:47.030
What brings you here today, Master Hiyu?

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:48.800
Something to do with him?

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:50.430
I came to get him...

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:53.370
to get Ryuji.

00:00:56.140 --> 00:01:01.770
I pray in the dark

00:01:06.650 --> 00:01:13.620
Just now, as the cold breeze blew against me

00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:22.120
I caught a sudden glimpse of a me that I'd lost

00:01:22.470 --> 00:01:26.710
It's fading away

00:01:26.710 --> 00:01:30.940
Vanishing in the faceless crowd

00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:35.010
My singing voice won't get through

00:01:35.010 --> 00:01:40.250
It will be drowned out

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:42.820
Answer me

00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:47.030
My prayer is a fleeting wish

00:01:47.030 --> 00:01:51.330
That could vanish any moment

00:01:51.330 --> 00:01:57.770
I can't erase the pain

00:01:57.770 --> 00:02:03.980
But I gather up light with my words

00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:08.210
So it will reach far, far away

00:02:08.210 --> 00:02:14.850
I can't erase the tears, but...

00:02:14.850 --> 00:02:20.590
I pray in the dark

00:02:24.230 --> 00:02:26.600
I need to do someone a little favor.

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:28.230
I'll head out in a bit.

00:02:31.070 --> 00:02:32.900
I'll do it...

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:34.700
Oh, I'll do it all right!

00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:38.600
You just watch, bro!

00:02:40.850 --> 00:02:41.470
The Eighth Night

00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:42.980
Stars of Fate Chapter

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:46.710
Story of Suzaku ~ Destruction Day

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:49.650
Oh, Kyochee, long time, no see!

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:50.720
Don't call me that!

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:52.460
And it's only been three days!

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:55.590
Oh, you! Don't tell me you were off
cheating on us somewhere!

00:02:55.590 --> 00:02:57.260
Oh, perish the thought!

00:02:57.260 --> 00:02:58.430
Perish the thought!

00:02:58.430 --> 00:02:59.970
"Cheating" nothing!
It's not like you guys are...

00:02:59.970 --> 00:03:01.330
You were cheating?!

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:04.540
And what are you two doing here anyway?

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:06.240
Workin' part-time!

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:07.370
Exclusive scoop!

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:10.340
"24 Hours Behind the Scenes in the
Life of Magami's Wild Child!"

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:13.180
Haven't seen you either, Strawberry Boy!

00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:14.180
Hi.

00:03:14.180 --> 00:03:17.680
Say, isn't it a bore hanging around
with the guys all the time?

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:19.480
Why not hang out with your
big sis once in a while?

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:21.250
You're right, so then...

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:23.360
No! Don't be fooled!

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:25.590
This individual is your big bro, kid.

00:03:25.590 --> 00:03:26.690
Is that right?

00:03:26.690 --> 00:03:28.390
Call her your big sis!

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:31.520
Oh, no! Not the sumaki roll punishment!

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:33.690
Oh, brother...

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:35.830
By the way...

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:37.470
You're a new face around here!

00:03:37.470 --> 00:03:41.240
Oh, save me! Kyochee's friends
are all such cuties!

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:43.040
Oh, so vibrant!

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:45.740
He looks juicy!

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:48.310
You girls are all very beautiful yourselves.

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:50.280
Oh, stop!
You're too kind!

00:03:58.390 --> 00:04:00.360
What are you trying to do?

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:02.590
Oh, nothing.

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:03.760
TATSUMA CLAlRE'S

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:05.600
TATSUMA CLAlRE'S
Oh, Tatsuma...

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:06.200
Oh, Tatsuma...

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:08.530
What do you think? Looks tasty, doesn't it?

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:09.600
You okay?

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:10.940
It's not too hot, is it?

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:12.870
Let me blow on it for you!

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:14.370
Look, you...

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:16.480
Hey, Koni! Where're the pot stickers?
Pot stickers!

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:18.080
Er, coming right up!

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:19.510
Shouldn't that be "Mr." Koni to you?

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:21.580
Hey, where shall we have our honeymoon?

00:04:21.580 --> 00:04:23.850
Nepal? Rio? Amsterdam, maybe?

00:04:23.850 --> 00:04:27.190
Sheesh, he's going to have a hard time
eating with you clinging to him.

00:04:27.190 --> 00:04:28.850
Who asked you, you nosey barbarian?!

00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:31.420
Why don't you get a clue?

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:33.260
You get a clue!

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:34.260
Hah!

00:04:34.260 --> 00:04:37.630
As a matter of fact,
Tatsuma asked me to marry him.

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:39.000
No, I didn't.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:40.620
There, see?

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:45.140
Why, you little creep!

00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:48.260
Oh, Tatsuma! He's scaring me!

00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:50.910
I get it.

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:55.540
So, you mean to treat me like a friend,
and "open up" my heart, is that it?

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:58.520
This tactic is very like you.

00:04:58.520 --> 00:04:59.650
Not really.

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:02.280
But it won't work on me, you know.

00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:08.290
Hey, Kyouichi...

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:11.230
That guy is Chaos, right?

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:12.500
Yeah...

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:14.200
You don't say?

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:17.330
Angie and the other two don't
seem to have noticed,

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:20.040
but he does have a weird aura
about him, doesn't he?

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:21.440
Is this all right?

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:23.710
Why is Hiyu doing this?

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:25.240
Heck if I know.

00:05:25.240 --> 00:05:27.710
But that's what Tatsuma has decided.

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:29.850
It'll be all right.

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:31.620
I'll keep my eye on them.

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:32.620
Okay...

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:35.590
You just be careful too, okay?

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:37.290
I know.

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:38.720
Maybe it's just my imagination,

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:41.690
but Strawberry Boy seems like
he's gotten more...

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:47.930
Nah, just my imagination.

00:05:58.410 --> 00:05:59.880
Blood Type B
Sex M
Current Address
Tokyo, Sumida City, Ryokoku 1 2-8
Motana Manor 201
Name Tatsuma Hiyu
Student lD Number
Academic History

00:06:00.980 --> 00:06:02.780
Are you worried about Hiyu?

00:06:04.020 --> 00:06:06.920
Well, certainly, after an event like that...

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:10.910
But Hiyu seems to have gotten a hold of himself.

00:06:12.590 --> 00:06:14.390
He's a strong boy.

00:06:15.030 --> 00:06:18.330
Now, if only he could continue like
that and get past this.

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:20.830
Strong...

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:23.130
Yeah, sure he is.

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:35.280
Will it be okay?

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:37.680
If he starts controlling other people again...

00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:40.980
If he meant to, wouldn't he have done it by now?

00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:43.560
Maybe,

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:45.520
but we can't let him catch us off-guard.

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:48.290
He doesn't know either.

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:52.930
He doesn't know what Hiyu is going to do either.

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:56.390
So, I think he's watching.

00:06:56.870 --> 00:06:58.200
I get it.

00:06:58.200 --> 00:07:00.830
They're trying to anticipate
each other's next move.

00:07:03.140 --> 00:07:06.210
I don't know either.

00:07:06.210 --> 00:07:07.250
I mean...

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:08.580
I mean,

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:11.710
he killed Hiyu's father and mother!

00:07:12.550 --> 00:07:14.220
And lots of others...

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:17.350
I still can't get what he said out of my head!

00:07:17.590 --> 00:07:19.960
To care for a scumbag like him...

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.230
It's so...

00:07:21.230 --> 00:07:22.430
Komaki...

00:07:22.430 --> 00:07:24.220
Honestly, I feel the same.

00:07:25.260 --> 00:07:27.700
I won't tell him to seek revenge.

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:29.330
Still...

00:07:29.870 --> 00:07:32.670
Why would Hiyu let him get away with it?

00:07:33.070 --> 00:07:34.700
I know.

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:37.210
I don't understand either.

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:42.010
Or rather, in my mind I do understand
that he should forgive him;

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:45.820
that he must save that person's soul.

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:51.990
But I'm sure that Hiyu must be suffering too.

00:07:54.430 --> 00:07:58.060
Hiyu is still fighting now.

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:11.000
You do hate me, right?

00:08:11.410 --> 00:08:12.740
I'm not sure.

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:16.040
Yeah, maybe I do.

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:18.650
Well, whatever.

00:08:18.650 --> 00:08:21.950
So, where will you take me next?

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:27.860
Hello...

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:29.990
Hey, I've been waiting for ya.

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:40.410
What are these?

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:43.270
A robbery-murder victim and
an overdose subject,

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:47.730
and the one at the bottom is a victim
in last week's Chaos case.

00:08:48.610 --> 00:08:51.350
We can't determine his identity,

00:08:51.350 --> 00:08:53.320
so we can't dispose of him either.

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:55.650
Chaos case?

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:59.020
Oh, I see. They haven't made
it public yet, huh?

00:08:59.590 --> 00:09:04.050
All of the murder suspects say the name
"Chaos" and commit suicide.

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:07.000
It's like they were under some kind of hypnosis.

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:09.430
See, there's been a whole
rash of cases like that.

00:09:09.430 --> 00:09:11.070
I see...

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:14.470
Seems like they suddenly stopped
after last weekend,

00:09:14.470 --> 00:09:16.940
but keep this info between us, okay?

00:09:17.340 --> 00:09:19.680
Oh, yes, of course.

00:09:19.680 --> 00:09:23.140
Um, Hiyu, could it be that your
parents were also...

00:09:23.480 --> 00:09:24.480
You little...

00:09:24.480 --> 00:09:26.110
Kyouichi...

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:29.380
I don't know what to say...

00:09:30.190 --> 00:09:31.990
I'm so sorry for you.

00:09:34.530 --> 00:09:37.630
There were probably so many things
they still wanted to do in life.

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:39.260
It's so sad.

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:43.230
People her age are also dropping like flies.

00:09:43.230 --> 00:09:46.200
There've been some pretty awful things
going down this past year.

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:47.840
Awful things?

00:09:47.840 --> 00:09:49.610
It doesn't seem like the work
of people so much...

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:53.280
as animals, or monsters, even.

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:55.280
I know about that from the news.

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:57.180
There have been a number of things like that.

00:09:57.180 --> 00:10:01.310
There's also some bunch of nut jobs who've been
going around killing off the monsters.

00:10:02.050 --> 00:10:03.560
What are you talking about?

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:05.350
Maybe you're watching a little
too much TV there.

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:07.450
Heh, maybe.

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:12.160
Do you know why I'm doing this job?

00:10:13.870 --> 00:10:16.770
I take apart corpses to find out
the cause of death.

00:10:16.770 --> 00:10:19.500
I discern what their last moment was.

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:22.010
The dead can't speak out loud,

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:24.780
but they are saying something.

00:10:24.780 --> 00:10:28.410
Ordinary people can't hear those quiet voices.

00:10:30.950 --> 00:10:33.690
I listen to their voices,

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:36.480
and then I tell their families.

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:40.920
I impart the final messages that
these people left behind.

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:46.660
One day, a loved one's life is
taken all of a sudden.

00:10:47.230 --> 00:10:50.530
You don't know the reason or who did it.

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:54.470
Do you understand what that's like?

00:10:54.470 --> 00:10:58.600
It's more than the dead OR
the mourning can bear.

00:10:59.110 --> 00:11:01.910
Do you understand how it feels?

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:06.050
I do understand.

00:11:06.050 --> 00:11:07.610
I really do...

00:11:08.990 --> 00:11:11.620
Cut out the polite act, boy.

00:11:12.890 --> 00:11:16.090
When you do this job, you start
understanding, see.

00:11:16.090 --> 00:11:18.390
When you look into people's eyes...

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:22.300
You know who's used to seeing
corpses and who's not.

00:11:22.300 --> 00:11:25.760
You know who's used to murder and who's not.

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:28.160
You're...

00:11:30.380 --> 00:11:32.780
Hey, isn't the grub ready yet?

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:33.810
What'd you say?

00:11:33.810 --> 00:11:36.750
Sheesh, Master Arai is one thing...

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:40.820
...but having two freeloaders here places
a burden on us financially.

00:11:40.820 --> 00:11:42.320
Ah, sorry about that.

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:45.260
Even if that weren't the case,
you two still eat a lot!

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:48.130
We at least need something to
cover food expenses.

00:11:48.130 --> 00:11:49.920
Forgive us!

00:11:51.030 --> 00:11:53.830
The time of Chi You is drawing near.

00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:57.000
Three more days...

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:58.800
Will he move for sure?

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:02.440
Master...

00:12:02.440 --> 00:12:07.340
Could the deaths of Tatsuma Hiyu's foster
parents have anything to do with this?

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:11.940
And is this Ryuji Yashiro with
Yagyu as we had thought?

00:12:13.180 --> 00:12:14.980
I do not know.

00:12:15.220 --> 00:12:17.190
But that boy...

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:21.320
Yeah, he resembles Tatsuma.

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:23.530
Resembles?

00:12:23.530 --> 00:12:25.100
You mean Hiyu and Yashiro?

00:12:25.100 --> 00:12:25.200
Kisaragi Antiques
You mean Hiyu and Yashiro?

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:26.430
Kisaragi Antiques
You think?

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:27.800
Kisaragi Antiques
I don't think I'd say they really
"resemble" each other.

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:28.300
I don't think I'd say they really
"resemble" each other.

00:12:28.300 --> 00:12:30.800
I believe they're complete opposites actually.

00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:32.200
You know it!

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:34.670
If you look closely, you'll understand.

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:39.940
If you were to liken Tatsuma to the moon,
then Yashiro would be the sun.

00:12:40.180 --> 00:12:41.810
However...

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:44.020
It's Chaos!

00:12:44.020 --> 00:12:47.210
I've got the title of Chaos!

00:12:52.220 --> 00:12:53.790
Trying to harass me?

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:55.420
Not really.

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:10.000
Bro...

00:13:29.190 --> 00:13:31.490
Nice disguise you got yourself there.

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:36.070
Falsified public records,
sneaking into the country...

00:13:36.070 --> 00:13:38.700
Yes, this is a case of sending a
sneak to catch a sneak.

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:42.400
Who are you? Only authorized
staff is allowed in here.

00:13:42.870 --> 00:13:47.000
It doesn't matter how cleverly you lay your plan;
there's bound to be a flaw.

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:50.980
I don't know how it seems to your kind, but...

00:13:52.820 --> 00:13:56.620
...seventeen years is a long time.

00:13:57.860 --> 00:13:59.820
What is this about?

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:05.430
There's something I want to ask you.

00:14:11.440 --> 00:14:13.000
Ryuzo!

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:14.670
B.. Boss...

00:14:14.670 --> 00:14:17.340
It... She is a monster, like we thought!

00:14:17.340 --> 00:14:19.780
In human skin...

00:14:19.780 --> 00:14:21.400
What happened?!

00:14:21.850 --> 00:14:23.180
The damn bitch...

00:14:23.180 --> 00:14:25.310
She bit me pretty deep.

00:14:26.520 --> 00:14:27.520
Ryuzo!

00:14:27.520 --> 00:14:28.820
Hey, Ryuzo!

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:38.020
The real Maria Alucard died twenty years ago.

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:40.700
Deplorable...

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:48.200
Now, how about you spill the beans?

00:14:54.510 --> 00:14:55.750
Ryuta!

00:14:55.750 --> 00:14:57.370
I found you...

00:14:58.050 --> 00:15:00.850
I found you, you goddamn monster!

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:07.060
Ryuta!

00:15:07.060 --> 00:15:08.690
Damn bitch!

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:12.900
Did ya see that freak, Boss?

00:15:12.900 --> 00:15:15.030
That was a helluva face!

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:16.660
Ryuta...

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:38.110
Bro...

00:15:57.110 --> 00:15:58.910
Run, Ryuta!

00:16:18.300 --> 00:16:19.960
Monster...

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:22.760
Give my brother back, you damn bitch!

00:16:26.370 --> 00:16:28.000
Ryuta!

00:16:29.970 --> 00:16:31.600
Dear me...

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:36.510
You!

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:38.720
I see, so you're one too.

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:41.290
You monsters protect each other, do you?

00:16:41.290 --> 00:16:42.590
Not necessarily...

00:16:42.590 --> 00:16:44.560
I merely can't stomach this.

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:46.290
What?

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:48.090
You know, don't you?

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:54.650
This is revenge, for my brother!

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:58.140
She didn't do that.

00:16:58.140 --> 00:17:01.940
She hadn't yet come to Japan
seventeen years ago.

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:08.780
Human beings don't change, do they?

00:17:08.780 --> 00:17:13.820
You steal others' lives just to satisfy
your own small hearts.

00:17:13.820 --> 00:17:16.450
Over and over, with no end in sight...

00:17:16.920 --> 00:17:18.550
Good grief...

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:23.420
If you want, I'll take your lives.

00:17:24.230 --> 00:17:25.430
Shoot him, Boss!

00:17:25.430 --> 00:17:27.730
He's one of them, Boss!

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:35.770
It seems it would be better for
us to withdraw for now.

00:17:35.770 --> 00:17:37.400
Boss!

00:17:37.710 --> 00:17:40.510
Well, now, rather wise for a human.

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:43.610
No monster has any business saying that to me.

00:17:43.610 --> 00:17:45.380
Boss...

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:46.720
No...

00:17:46.720 --> 00:17:47.920
No!

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:49.420
Give it up!

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:51.460
You know it too.

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:56.230
That's not the one who killed
your brother, Ryuzo.

00:17:56.230 --> 00:17:57.330
It doesn't matter!

00:17:57.330 --> 00:17:59.260
She's comrades with the one
who killed my brother!

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:00.800
They're all the same!

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:04.100
I'm fine with annihilating all her other
comrades around the world!

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:05.800
Ryuta...

00:18:05.800 --> 00:18:07.740
Why, Boss?!

00:18:07.740 --> 00:18:10.910
We finally did it, we found her!

00:18:10.910 --> 00:18:14.010
We've come this far, after all we've
been through together!

00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:16.110
We've still got a ways to go.

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:18.080
I won't let this go.

00:18:19.420 --> 00:18:20.950
No!

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:23.080
I... I'll...

00:18:23.420 --> 00:18:25.050
Ryuta!

00:19:11.640 --> 00:19:14.640
I won't let you die too,

00:19:14.640 --> 00:19:20.010
because I'd never be able to face him.

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:22.770
Boss!

00:19:26.050 --> 00:19:30.850
How beautiful, the strength of these bonds
between people's hearts, indeed.

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:33.320
Good grief...

00:19:36.560 --> 00:19:40.860
Boss!

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:57.050
I've been waiting for you, Hiyu.

00:19:57.680 --> 00:20:00.550
I finally understand what you're thinking.

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:03.850
You do hate me after all, right?

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:07.630
That's why you tried to show me
the wrong I've done.

00:20:07.630 --> 00:20:10.860
But it's just no use.

00:20:10.860 --> 00:20:14.330
I thought I told you that I have no feelings?

00:20:14.330 --> 00:20:16.960
A soul is simply something I don't...

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:18.900
Here!

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:21.330
It's good.

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:31.580
The truth is I don't really like this strawberry
milk that much though.

00:20:33.150 --> 00:20:36.610
That's because my mom's is actually the best.

00:20:37.490 --> 00:20:40.120
I wanted to give you some of that too.

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:50.400
Don't give me that...

00:20:50.400 --> 00:20:51.870
Don't give me that crap!

00:20:51.870 --> 00:20:53.370
What the heck is your game here?!

00:20:53.370 --> 00:20:55.510
You take me around to see all
these worthless people

00:20:55.510 --> 00:20:57.780
and you show me the wrongs I've done,

00:20:57.780 --> 00:21:00.240
and after all that, you give me strawberry milk?!

00:21:00.240 --> 00:21:01.710
What do you think you're doing?!

00:21:01.710 --> 00:21:05.340
Stop trying to make an ass out of me!

00:21:11.090 --> 00:21:12.660
I'm glad.

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:14.390
What did you say?

00:21:14.390 --> 00:21:16.690
You're angry right now.

00:21:18.700 --> 00:21:21.160
You said you don't have any feelings, right?

00:21:23.530 --> 00:21:24.900
That's not true...

00:21:24.900 --> 00:21:27.640
It's not! I'm not angry at all.

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:30.110
I... I...

00:21:30.880 --> 00:21:35.010
It's perfectly normal to cry
and be angry and stuff.

00:21:39.050 --> 00:21:41.350
I'll make you laugh next.

00:22:01.370 --> 00:22:02.870
Is it Hiyu?

00:22:02.870 --> 00:22:05.500
No, this is different; it's...

00:22:06.610 --> 00:22:08.850
Oh, no, this is bad!

00:22:08.850 --> 00:22:10.650
This quickening mustn't happen!

00:22:10.650 --> 00:22:13.450
Life... Life will be lost!

00:22:13.880 --> 00:22:15.510
Is he here?!

00:22:20.560 --> 00:22:21.960
Guys, look!

00:22:21.960 --> 00:22:23.130
That's...

00:22:23.130 --> 00:22:24.230
Yagyu!

00:22:24.230 --> 00:22:26.200
Munetaka Yagyu!

00:22:26.930 --> 00:22:31.060
Have you awoken, vessel?

00:22:41.910 --> 00:22:47.020
I sadly hung my head a bit

00:22:47.020 --> 00:22:51.720
And finally you murmured

00:22:52.120 --> 00:22:56.360
What I heard was a faint goodbye

00:22:56.360 --> 00:23:01.300
Said with all your might

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:12.510
Our pulses echo in the awkward silence

00:23:12.510 --> 00:23:14.380
We can see each other again

00:23:14.380 --> 00:23:16.880
Let's meet up again some time

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:22.690
Let's each set out in search of our own futures

00:23:22.690 --> 00:23:27.190
For the kindness you gave me for my heartache

00:23:27.190 --> 00:23:31.630
I thank you now

00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:37.430
These flower petals seem just as if

00:23:37.430 --> 00:23:38.870
They were blessing us

00:23:38.870 --> 00:23:43.070
As we depart on our journeys

00:23:43.070 --> 00:23:47.440
I won't forget your warmth

00:23:47.440 --> 00:23:51.900
That overwhelmed my loneliness

00:23:52.720 --> 00:23:57.810
I thank you now

